        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Import Coordinator procure ICC stickers from BPS in the quantities authorized by the certificate, manage the sticker as a controlled/serialized consumable (receipt, secure storage, issuance), and reconcile sticker stock to certificates
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Import Coordinator / DC
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Per shipment + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
