Responsible (R): DC Team / Product Compliance Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: Varies by volume</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3678_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3678_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3678_Task7" name="Product Compliance Manager/Audit manage sticker integrity: periodic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager/Audit manage sticker integrity: periodic sticker-vs-certificate reconciliation, investigation of sticker shortage/discrepancy, control against theft/misuse, and audit reporting (links to W3672/VS-21); manage expired/obsolete sticker destruction
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3678_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3678_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
